OL,3,GNEWSA'Favourable winds' result in fewer
OL,4,AAsian hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of Asian hornets trapped
OL,7,Fthis year has almost halved compared to
OL,8,Flast year, a volunteer group has
OL,9,Freported.
OL,11,FAlderney Asian Hornet Group said 188
OL,12,FAsian hornet queens had been caught in
OL,13,Ftraps and two primary nests destroyed,
OL,14,Fa significant decrease on the
OL,15,Frecord-breaking number trapped last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe group said a total of 365 queens
OL,19,Fwere trapped in 2025, 99 were trapped
OL,20,Fin 2024 and 26 in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
