OL,3,GNEWSA'Favourable winds' result in fewer
OL,4,AAsian hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Jarolik, the group's
OL,7,Fadministrator, said they attributed the
OL,8,Flower numbers to to a "successful last
OL,9,Fseason and a favourable wind direction
OL,10,Fand strength from France".
